{"title": "Enhance Leap", "pageid": 2252, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Enhance_Leap", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Ritual spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Enhance_Leap.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Enhance_Leap.webp/300px-Enhance_Leap.webp, /w/images/5/5d/Enhance_Leap.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Enhance_Leap.webp/300px-Enhance_Leap.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Enhance_Leap.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Enhance Leap </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 transmutation spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to increase a creature's Jumping distance.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nTriple a creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jumping</a> distance.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Jump</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Jump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Jump\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Jump\"> Condition: Jump </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Condition)\" title=\"Jump (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Condition)\" title=\"Jump (Condition)\">Jump</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/38px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/50px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is tripled.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\">Magic Initiate: Druid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/38px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/50px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\">Ritual Caster: Free Spells</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Jumping\" title=\"Ring of Jumping\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Ring_of_Jumping_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Jumping\" title=\"Ring of Jumping\">Ring of Jumping</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Also granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> who choose the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocation\" title=\"Eldritch Invocation\">Eldritch Invocation</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Leap\" title=\"Otherworldly Leap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/30px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/40px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otherworldly Leap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otherworldly_Leap\" title=\"Otherworldly Leap\">Otherworldly Leap</a> at level 9+ as a ritual spell.</li>\n<li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell triples the base jump distance which is 4.5 m (15 ft) plus 1 m (3 ft) per 2 Strength above 10. Any additional modifiers such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/30px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/40px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\">Advanced Unarmoured Movement</a> are added after this multiplier is applied.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> have a similar racial version called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Psionics:_Jump\" title=\"Githyanki Psionics: Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/30px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/40px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki Psionics: Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Psionics:_Jump\" title=\"Githyanki Psionics: Jump\">Githyanki Psionics: Jump</a>, it can only be cast once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a> and does not use a spell slot.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Enhance Leap is <b>Mactē Virtutē</b>, the Latin command <i>\"honour with virtue!\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/b/b8/Enhanced_Leap_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Enhanced_Leap_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Enhanced_Leap_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" cla